Lunacy's First Use.

webOS put a First Use app in front of a new device: language, Wi-Fi, terms and the Palm
profile, each on its own page, before anything else could be reached. Lunacy's First Use asks
for what Lunacy needs from Android instead, and is written for Lunacy (source/FirstUse.js, the
stylesheet's layout rules).

The look is Palm's. images/ and the matching rules in css/firstuse.css come from Palm's own
First Use app (com.palm.app.firstuse, webOS 3.x), as reworked into webOS Archive's webOS
Account Manager 1.1.12 (webos-doctor-ce, AddToImage/OOBE), whose art and stylesheet are
Palm's unchanged. Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open
licence; distributed by Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad
wallpapers: no owner has asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.
